 Lists the MiSTer tape library: the PDP2011 core's folder on the SD
 card (games/PDP2011) and the folders below it. Folders are shown as
 NAME/.

 Format:
     TDIR                       the top: folders and tapes
     TDIR folder                a folder (RSTS, RSTS/V9.6, ...)
     TDIR [folder/]pattern      matching tapes (* matches anything)

 Case does not matter. Folders whose names start with _, and folders
 with no tapes below them, are not listed. TLOAD puts a tape on MT0:.
*Example
     $ TDIR RSTS/V9.6
       RSTS/V9.6/rsts_v9_6_install.tap
       RSTS/V9.6/rsts_v9_6_install_raw.tap
     2 tapes in this folder
